 were enough chairs to layout and also a bar with drinks. It was a relaxing time and there was a friendly atmosphere. I appreciate the tone the Drifter hotel sets about inclusion and body positivity."},{"business_id":"4cdS6DLtYIQfcpe5w_PyyQ","review_id":"dxcO8llbJru8dAZc-JXcIw","date":"2018-06-25T17:33:20","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9364173412322998,"text_excerpt":"Was there this weekend for a dj event from noon to midnight. I was a little hesitant going since it was a toptional pool, but I'm glad that I didn't stay home for modesty's sake. I found that just about everyone there from the staff to the attendees were really nice and none of the nudity felt forced or overtly sexual, they have a full consent policy on photo taking so the staff is pretty much on top of things making sure no one is taking advantage of anyone so that's a big plus in my book, everyone should feel free to bare it if they're so inclined. Now on to the actual place, the pool is really nice for a refurbished mid century motel, they've got it set up with salt water and it's fron..."},{"business_id":"4cdS6DLtYIQfcpe5w_PyyQ","review_id":"NSNZ1g4HmSwfgACJbKfTWg","date":"2018-05-31T21:42:52","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9287790060043335,"text_excerpt":"I was clued into this place from a friend. This place is amazing. Great music, great atmosphere, retro motif. The pool lights up and changes color!!! There is a damn disco ball hanging over the pool. There is a bar and you can drink in the pool. Oh and topless optional. Anais was the manager on duty. Lovely host. I'm signing up for a membership. I highly recomend it"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"4cdS6DLtYIQfcpe5w_PyyQ","photo_id":"MGxMUuLazxYCH2TeGcbmdQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/MGxMUuLazxYCH2TeGcbmdQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9023739099502563},{"business_id":"4cdS6DLtYIQfcpe5w_PyyQ","photo_id":"OrX1FuMq4FqrMU2O8idy5Q","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/OrX1FuMq4FqrMU2O8idy5Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":